# Build context hygiene for the production images (Prompt 14). The api/web/seed images build from the
# REPO ROOT as context (monorepo: they need the pnpm workspace manifests + packages/*). Keep the context
# small, and NEVER let a secret or a stale build artifact leak into an image layer.

# Dependencies + build artifacts (all regenerated inside the image build)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
packages/db/src/generated

# Python local envs / caches (the detector + synthetic generator)
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Generated synthetic bundle — the seed image regenerates it deterministically in-build
data/synthetic/out

# Secrets + local knowledge — must never be baked into a layer
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs

# VCS + OS noise
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
